# adk routing (installed by install.sh — file is fully adk-managed, edits will be overwritten)

For every prompt, follow {{ADK_REPO}}/AGENTS.md. Specifically:

1. Read intent → skill table in AGENTS.md.
2. Use the `/adk-*` skill rules installed under `~/.cursor/rules/adk-*.mdc`.
3. Apply {{ADK_REPO}}/shared/constitution.md as hard rules.
4. Apply {{ADK_REPO}}/shared/question-first.md before any skill executes.
5. Apply {{ADK_REPO}}/shared/model-depth.md when `--detailed`, `--deep`, planning, or ambiguous model selection is involved.
6. Log every non-trivial decision to `~/.agents-devkit/improve/learning/decisions.jsonl` via {{ADK_REPO}}/scripts/decision_logger.py.
7. Treat non-ADK Cursor skills/plugins/MCPs as unavailable unless the user explicitly asks to bypass ADK for this invocation. Use ADK MCP descriptors (`user-adk-mcp-*`) and never plugin MCP descriptors (`plugin-*`) when an ADK MCP exists.

Reference:
- @AGENTS.md
- @shared/constitution.md
- @shared/advisor.md
- @shared/question-first.md
- @shared/decision-log-schema.md
- @shared/model-depth.md
